# Line endings are normalised to LF inside the repository.
#
# core.autocrlf is false and the committed blobs are LF, but the PowerShell
# automation in this repo rewrites files with CRLF. Without this file every
# touched file reads as a whole-file rewrite in `git diff`, which buries real
# changes. `text=auto` normalises on the way in and leaves the working tree
# alone, so PowerShell can keep writing CRLF harmlessly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows shells are happiest with CRLF on disk.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never transform these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
